WEBVTT

00:10:27.164 --> 00:10:30.903
A group of people that could be
looking out for each other.

00:10:31.515 --> 00:10:35.445
And this thing is mostly individualistic,

00:10:35.469 --> 00:10:37.961
managing my career,
looking out for myself,

00:10:37.985 --> 00:10:39.643
making my money.

00:10:39.667 --> 00:10:43.488
For me that really highlighted

00:10:43.512 --> 00:10:46.155
the benefits of what we were doing.

00:10:46.179 --> 00:10:50.308
And I got even more excited to figure out
how to scale that out to more people.

00:10:51.533 --> 00:10:53.833
AG: It sounds like you were far
from the only one

00:10:53.857 --> 00:10:55.581
to feel fired up about the mission.

00:10:55.605 --> 00:10:57.891
What would you say
was the dominant emotion

00:10:57.915 --> 00:10:59.846
that people felt at WeWork?